  <div class="wrap page-body">
    <h1 class="page-title">about me</h1>
    <img class="portrait" src="/images/about-rohit.png" alt="Rohit Kumar" width="1024" height="791" />
    <div class="prose">
      <p>With over 24 years of experience in the India aviation industry, I’ve had the privilege of flying with two of India’s leading airlines—spending 13 years with Air India and 9 years with IndiGo Airlines. As a pilot and a trainer, training young pilots, my learning has been that flying airplanes is not just about a pilot’s ability to interact with a machine, it also includes the ability of a pilot to make decisions in critical situations as well as having the foresight to avoid those critical situations by identifying risks and mitigating those risks, through focus, problem solving, awareness of the operational environment and to always have a plan which is efficient with enough safety nets.</p>
      <p>As I trained pilots for these skills, I have been able to identify reference points in cognitive, emotional and physical behavior which makes a successful pilot.</p>
      <p>Recently, I’ve expanded my horizons by taking up life coaching. As an ICF trained level 2 coach, I intend to bring in all my learnings from the cockpit to life coaching. I intend to help individuals, professionals and students in their own journey to achieve their personal goals, overcoming challenges and having a fulfilling and engaging life, full of choices. Have the life skills required to be able to make choices that resonates with their own life’s purpose.</p>
      <p>As I continue to pilot both aircraft and personal transformations, I firmly believe that each individual has the ability to have FLOW in their personal life, relationships, money and career. I remain passionate about bringing about that FLOW in the lives of those I work with.</p>
      <p>If you are interested in enhancing your decision-making, achieving your goals, or finding that perfect FLOW in life, I would be happy to connect on <a href="https://topmate.io/rowit" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Topmate</a>. I’m here to support your journey—whether in the skies or in life.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="cta-box">
      <p>Ready to explore your personal flight path?</p>
      <a class="btn" href="https://topmate.io/rowit" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Book a session</a>
    </div>
